nt-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> million in goodwill as the result of the business combination with Barnes &amp; Noble Education on June 10, 2024. </span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">See </span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-style:italic;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Note 3. Business Combination</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> in the Company&#8217;s Annual Report on Form 10-K for the fiscal year ended April 30, 2026 for additional information.</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> The carrying value of goodwill was $</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_a4304200-1ba9-4f58-ad46-efd8588d6769" contextRef="C_ed62062c-16af-46e9-9188-f996c466edf9" name="us-gaap:Goodwill" unitRef="U_USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal"><ix:nonFraction id="F_3057d420-6fa1-424e-8fd0-97115eb5ac4e" contextRef="C_269eea2c-51dc-4e11-ac0b-69f3272c2108" name="us-gaap:Goodwill" unitRef="U_USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">69.2</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> million as of </span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">July 31, 2026 and April 30, 2026. The Company did not record any goodwill impairment losses during the three months ended July 31, 2026, and 2025.</span>